		{
			"id": "hgCwl98x",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3345,
			"y": 1924,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 356.25,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e293b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1059471196,
			"version": 1,
			"versionNonce": 816530216,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"updated": 1794648075157,
			"created": 1794648075157,
			"index": "b8m",
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 19,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"text": "SCHEMA + QUERY INDEXES\n\nPosts(post_id PK, author_id, content, created_at)\nINDEX(author_id, created_at DESC, post_id DESC)\n\nFollows(follower_id, following_id)\nUNIQUE(follower_id, following_id)\nINDEX(following_id, follower_id)\n\nFeedEntries(user_id, post_id, published_at)\nUNIQUE(user_id, post_id)\nINDEX(user_id, published_at DESC, post_id DESC)\n\nOutbox(event_id PK, type, payload, state)\nShard / partition timeline data by user_id.",
			"originalText": "SCHEMA + QUERY INDEXES\n\nPosts(post_id PK, author_id, content, created_at)\nINDEX(author_id, created_at DESC, post_id DESC)\n\nFollows(follower_id, following_id)\nUNIQUE(follower_id, following_id)\nINDEX(following_id, follower_id)\n\nFeedEntries(user_id, post_id, published_at)\nUNIQUE(user_id, post_id)\nINDEX(user_id, published_at DESC, post_id DESC)\n\nOutbox(event_id PK, type, payload, state)\nShard / partition timeline data by user_id.",
			"boundElements": [],
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "xPnwpXQN",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 4103,
			"y": 1924,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 285,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e293b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 714444185,
			"version": 1,
			"versionNonce": 2086850865,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"updated": 1794648075157,
			"created": 1794648075157,
			"index": "b8n",
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 19,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"text": "CONSISTENCY + FAILURE HANDLING\n\n- Posts + outbox saved in ONE transaction\n- Kafka delivery is at least once, NOT exactly once\n- Retry/replay; consumer inserts are idempotent\n- Broken messages -> dead-letter handling\n- Redis down -> bounded durable-store fallback\n- Unfollow/delete -> read-time visibility filter\n- Async cleanup + invalidation handles stale IDs\n- Rate limiting + backpressure protect services\n- Multi-AZ replication, leader fencing, backups\n- Observe consumer lag + outbox backlog",
			"originalText": "CONSISTENCY + FAILURE HANDLING\n\n- Posts + outbox saved in ONE transaction\n- Kafka delivery is at least once, NOT exactly once\n- Retry/replay; consumer inserts are idempotent\n- Broken messages -> dead-letter handling\n- Redis down -> bounded durable-store fallback\n- Unfollow/delete -> read-time visibility filter\n- Async cleanup + invalidation handles stale IDs\n- Rate limiting + backpressure protect services\n- Multi-AZ replication, leader fencing, backups\n- Observe consumer lag + outbox backlog",
			"boundElements": [],
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "lQqs5B1z",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 4861,
			"y": 1924,
			"width": 690,
			"height": 380,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e293b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 454850320,
			"version": 1,
			"versionNonce": 796089079,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"updated": 1794648075157,
			"created": 1794648075157,
			"index": "b8o",
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 19,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"text": "TRAFFIC ESTIMATES (ASSUMPTIONS)\n\n100M DAU x 10 reads/day = 1B reads/day\n= 11,574 avg read RPS / 115,741 peak (10x)\n\n10M posts/day = 116 avg post RPS\n= 1,157 peak post RPS (10x)\n\n10M posts x 500B = ~5GB raw/day\n~1.8TB raw content/year (no media/replicas)\n\n500 followers avg => up to 5B FeedEntries/day\n= ~57,870 timeline writes/sec avg\n\nValidate p99 <100ms feed (cache hits) and\n<500ms post create with load tests & budgets.",
			"originalText": "TRAFFIC ESTIMATES (ASSUMPTIONS)\n\n100M DAU x 10 reads/day = 1B reads/day\n= 11,574 avg read RPS / 115,741 peak (10x)\n\n10M posts/day = 116 avg post RPS\n= 1,157 peak post RPS (10x)\n\n10M posts x 500B = ~5GB raw/day\n~1.8TB raw content/year (no media/replicas)\n\n500 followers avg => up to 5B FeedEntries/day\n= ~57,870 timeline writes/sec avg\n\nValidate p99 <100ms feed (cache hits) and\n<500ms post create with load tests & budgets.",
			"boundElements": [],
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
